{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/Slot"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(key:overline:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(key:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:overline:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:overline:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/Label"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a mandatory label (either a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" or a custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":"), and optional description, overline,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra label, and helper text, and slots."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (String)","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\")","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\", hasBoldLabel: true)","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(\"Title\").font(.headline)","            Text(\"Subtitle\").font(.caption)","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Title, Subtitle\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: .from(text: \"Overline\",","                        foregroundColor: theme.colors.contentBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme),","                        font: someFont)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Custom-view-label","text":"Custom view label","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing a custom view as label:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"hasBoldLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must provide an "},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This "},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Small-size-behavior","text":"Small size behavior","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".oudsListItemSize(.small)"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"overline"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"extraLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" properties are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure a compact layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"label"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bottomSlot"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}]},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textSlot"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .oudsListItemSize(.small)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemdata"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","beta":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSListItemData","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents16OUDSListItemDataV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Represents the main content displayed within a list item component such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSListItemData/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)":{"title":"init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","kind":"symbol",